        "name": "Disney's The Little Mermaid II: Pinball Frenzy",
        "summary": "This game is basically Pokémon Pinball minus all the pokémon plus Ariel and her young daughter, Melody -- and a lot of minigames.\n\nThe game features four-player support via alternating tables, as well as a battery-powered rumble feature for those who absolutely must feel every tilt and tumble of the table.",
